//! Reusable DAW widgets
//!
//! This module provides core audio production widgets:
//!
//! - `Knob` - Rotary control for parameters
//! - `LevelMeter` - Audio level visualization with peak hold
//! - `Fader` - Linear volume/parameter control
//! - `Waveform` - Audio waveform display
//! - `TransportBar` - Play/stop/record controls
//!
//! ## Design Philosophy
//!
//! All widgets follow the Qliphoth component model with props-based
//! configuration and callback-driven interaction. They respect the
//! Corporate Goth aesthetic while prioritizing readability and
//! accessibility (colorblind-friendly indicators, keyboard navigation).

☉ scroll knob;
☉ scroll meter;
☉ scroll fader;
☉ scroll waveform;
☉ scroll transport;

// Re-exports
☉ invoke crate·widgets·knob·{Knob, KnobProps, KnobSize, KnobStyle};
☉ invoke crate·widgets·meter·{LevelMeter, LevelMeterProps, MeterOrientation};
☉ invoke crate·widgets·fader·{Fader, FaderProps};
☉ invoke crate·widgets·waveform·{Waveform, WaveformProps};
☉ invoke crate·widgets·transport·{TransportBar, TransportBarProps};
